##
 * compiler/src/ir/mir/mir_opt.vri — MIR Optimization Pass Orchestrator
 * ====================================================================
 * VIRC-PLN-0004 Phase 9 / VIRC-ISS-0006: MIR Optimization Subsystem Orchestrator.
 *
 * Re-exports all scalar, control-flow, loop, SSA, aggregate, and memory
 * optimization passes from dedicated leaf modules under opt/.
 ##

